### GitHub Score Formula (New — Accurate)

```
GitHub Score = (
  Profile Completeness   × 0.10   [0-100]
  + Activity Score       × 0.20   [commits/year, push frequency]  
  + Repo Quality Avg     × 0.25   [per-repo: README, tests, CI, recency]
  + Tech Diversity       × 0.15   [# of distinct languages/frameworks]
  + Community Score      × 0.10   [stars, forks, followers, PRs to others]
  + Code Quality         × 0.20   [pattern scan + Gemini analysis]
)
```

